      "paragraph_requires": [
        "All outstanding stock options and warrants have been excluded from the calculation of the diluted loss per share for the years ended December 31, 2025 and December 31, 2024, since all such securities have an anti-dilutive effect.",
        "The Reverse Stock Split was effected on September 30, 2024 at 11:59 p.m. pursuant to an amendment to the Company\u2019s Certificate of Incorporation approved by the stockholders of the Company on September 16, 2024. The Company adjusted all ordinary shares, options, warrants, per share data and exercise prices included in these financial statements for all periods presented to reflect the Reverse Stock Split.",
        "(Except share data)"
      ],
      "reader_note": "Brainstorm Cell Therapeutics' 2024 and 2025 share and per-share amounts reflect the September 30, 2024 one-for-fifteen reverse split for all presented periods. Outstanding options and warrants are excluded because they are anti-dilutive. Dollar losses are displayed in thousands, while shares use full counts. Reported USD EPS and selected share counts are retained on the filing's split-adjusted basis.",
      "disposition": "REVIEWED_ALLOCATION_UNIT_AND_DILUTION_CONTEXT"
